unobtrusiveness|Noun|the quality of not sticking out in an unwelcome way
unoccupied|Adjective|not held or filled or in use - "an unoccupied telephone booth" - "unoccupied hours";not leased to or occupied by a tenant - "an unoccupied apartment";not seized and controlled - "unoccupied areas of France"
